{"about_the_game":"Cat is a simple clicker game where you earn cats, buy upgrades, gain achievements and collect items by playing the game.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">32 achievements<li>24 upgrades<br></li><li>26 cats<br></li><li>Auto-save function<br></li><li>Customization options</li></ul><br><strong>Item drop pool:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>75% Common<br></li><li>20% Uncommon<br></li><li>4% Rare<br></li><li>1% Epic</li></ul><br><strong>Q: Why Should I Play This Game?</strong><br>A: Cats<br><br><strong>Q: Isn't that just a copy of the Steam game Banana, but named Cat?</strong><br>A: No. Cat gives you more gameplay choices like upgrades and changing your cat avatar.<br><br><strong>Q: Is this an NFT game?</strong><br>A: No, cats are not connected to any blockchain.<br><br><strong>Warning:</strong> This game is a clicker, not an RPG with three times the map size, five times the graphics, and ten times more quests than the XYZ game. Most of the time, you will just click the cat button and spend your cats on upgrades.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408310/5882b5a5307f4c2187ed0b2088327a796cf346b3.jpg"},{"name":"10000 Cats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408310/c453234e9dd782bd7b52ab237388884e804915eb.jpg"},{"name":"First million ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408310/3b1cc3445c576683a7398970817e6c4e08399896.jpg"},{"name":"Max paws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408310/d5372e77f64797e47473d65ee02d66e57771e80c.jpg"},{"name":"Max robocats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408310/44ecd628a701d7e549c48cfe922c2efae47c0777.jpg"},{"name":"Max luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408310/f5c23ce753920e68fa77d6f534297